    html: '<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>\n<header class="dra-header"><div class="dra-header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/dra-nav-logo.webp" alt="DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo" decoding="async"></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/credit-resources.html">Credit Services</a><a href="/tax-services.html">Tax Preparation</a><a href="/tax-mentorship.html">Tax Mentorship</a><a href="/about.html">About / Contact</a></nav><a class="dra-contact" href="/contact.html" aria-current="page">Let’s Talk</a></div></header>\n<main id="main">\n<div class="hero-navy"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Contact Us</div><h1>Contact Us</h1><p>Have a question about tax preparation, credit education, or your next step? Call, email, or book a Financial Blueprint Review.</p></div></div>\n<section class="band-white"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Get In Touch</div><h2>Get In Touch</h2><p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/DownRightAwesomeWealth/">Facebook</a> · <a href="https://www.instagram.com/downrightawesomewealth/">Instagram</a> · <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@deneshiarenee">TikTok</a></p><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Email</h3><p><a href="mailto:admin@downrightausomewealth.com">admin@downrightausomewealth.com</a></p></div><div class="card"><h3>Phone</h3><p><a class="phone-link" href="tel:+14705161141">470 516 1141</a></p></div><div class="card"><h3>Address</h3><p>3205 Woodward Crossing Blvd, Suite F, Buford, GA 30519</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Assistance Hours</h3><p>Mon &ndash; Sat 9:00am &ndash; 8:00pm<br>Sunday &ndash; Closed</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class="band-ivory"><div class="form-card"><h2>Request your review</h2><p>Schedule a Financial Blueprint Review or contact us with a question about tax or credit services.</p><p><a class="btn" href="book-an-appointment.html">Book An Appointment</a></p><p><a href="mailto:admin@downrightausomewealth.com">admin@downrightausomewealth.com</a> · <a href="tel:+14705161141">470-516-1141</a></p></div></section>\n<section class="band-white"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">FAQs</div><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="wrap"><details><summary>How long does the credit repair process take?</summary><p>The duration of the credit repair process varies depending on your unique credit situation. On average, it takes about 3 to 6 months to start seeing significant improvements in your credit score. However, some cases may take longer, while others might see results sooner. Our team works diligently to expedite the process and get you back on track as quickly as possible.</p></details><details><summary>Can I repair my credit on my own without professional help?</summary><p>While it\'s possible to attempt credit repair on your own, it can be a complex and time-consuming process. Credit repair professionals have the experience, knowledge, and tools to navigate the intricacies of credit reporting, dispute negative items effectively, and maximize your results. Additionally, they can provide you with guidance tailored to your specific financial situation, potentially saving you both time and money in the long run.</p></details><details><summary>Will using a credit repair service negatively impact my credit score?</summary><p>No, enlisting the services of a reputable credit repair company should not have a negative impact on your credit score. In fact, improving your credit is the primary goal. We work to dispute inaccurate or unfair negative items on your credit report and advocate for your rights under consumer protection laws. The temporary fluctuations in your credit score during the repair process are typically minimal, and the long-term benefit of a better credit score far outweighs any short-term fluctuations.</p></details></div></section>\n\n<div class="final-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Prefer to book directly?</h2><p>Book a Financial Blueprint Review and choose a time that fits your schedule.</p><a class="btn" href="book-an-appointment.html">Book An Appointment</a></div></div>\n</main>\n<footer class="interior-footer"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-col"><img src="/assets/dra-nav-logo.webp" alt="DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo" decoding="async"><p><strong>Deneshia Renee</strong><br>CEO<br>Down Right Ausome Wealth</p><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/dra.taxsolutions/">Instagram: dra.taxsolutions</a></p></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Explore</h4><a href="/">Home</a><a href="tax-services.html">Tax Services</a><a href="resources.html">Resources</a><a href="about.html">About</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a><a href="book-an-appointment.html">Book An Appointment</a></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Services</h4><a href="resources.html">Resources</a><a href="tax-services.html">Tax Preparation</a><a href="contact.html">Financial Coaching</a></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Let&rsquo;s Connect</h4><p><a class="phone-link" href="tel:+14705161141">470 516 1141</a></p><p><a href="mailto:admin@downrightausomewealth.com">admin@downrightausomewealth.com</a></p><p>3205 Woodward Crossing Blvd, Suite F, Buford, GA</p><p>Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00am&ndash;8:00pm, Sunday closed</p></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>&copy; 2026 Down Right Ausome Wealth. All rights reserved.</span><span><a href="testimonials.html">Testimonials</a> <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a> &middot; <a href="disclaimer.html">Disclaimer</a></span></div><div class="compliance">No outcome, score increase, refund, or approval is guaranteed.</div></footer>\n',
