    title: "What Our Clients Say | Down Right Ausome Wealth",
    html: '<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>\n<header class="dra-header"><div class="dra-header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/dra-nav-logo.webp" alt="DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo" decoding="async"></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/credit-resources.html">Credit Services</a><a href="/tax-services.html">Tax Preparation</a><a href="/tax-mentorship.html">Tax Mentorship</a><a href="/about.html">About / Contact</a></nav></div></header>\n<style>.testimonial-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,16rem),1fr));gap:1.25rem}.testimonial-card{margin:0;padding:1.25rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5ded1;border-radius:.75rem}.testimonial-img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.testimonial-card footer{padding:0;background:none;color:inherit;font-weight:700}</style><main id="main">\n<div class="cinematic-hero"><img class="hero-img" src="https://preview-draw.wattsunified.com/hero-testimonials.webp" alt="A bright desk with a laptop showing a rising credit score graph, a gold pen, and a small plant in a gold pot"><div class="hero-text"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Down Right Ausome Wealth • Testimonials</div><h1>Look What Our Clients Have To Say!</h1><p>Real clients, real results. Here is what a few of our clients had to say about working with us.</p></div></div></div>\n<section class="band-ivory"><div class="wrap"><div class="testimonial-grid">\n<blockquote class="testimonial-card"><img class="testimonial-img" src="https://preview-draw.wattsunified.com/testimonial-sara.webp" alt="Sara B.\'s credit scores on March 4, 2024: Equifax 718, Experian 681, TransUnion 649"><p>“Down Right Ausome Wealth and her team are really great and work hard. They have removed so much from my reports and only a few months into it. I am definitely glad that I went with this company and would recommend them to anyone!”</p><footer>–Sara B.</footer></blockquote>\n<blockquote class="testimonial-card"><img class="testimonial-img" src="https://preview-draw.wattsunified.com/testimonial-carlos.webp" alt="Carlos R.\'s credit results on October 7: Equifax 693, Experian 684, TransUnion 692"><p>“I had someone working on my credit for 2 years and barely did anything! Down Right Ausome Wealth has been working on my credit for 2 months and got EVERYTHING deleted! Please go to them you won\'t regret it!”</p><footer>–Carlos R</footer></blockquote>\n<blockquote class="testimonial-card"><img class="testimonial-img" src="https://preview-draw.wattsunified.com/testimonial-tim.webp" alt="Tim H.\'s credit scores on March 9, 2024: Equifax 725, Experian 756, TransUnion 732"><p>“Down Right Ausome Wealth is absolutely great! My credit score has gone up over 100 points! They always explain the process to me and I am consistently receiving emails on new disputes and deletions! This company has changed my life, I am so much closer to my financial goals now. After using other companies with no results, Down Right Ausome Wealth has all of my faith and confidence in the services they offer.”</p><footer>–Tim H.</footer></blockquote>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class="band-white"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center"><h2>Ready to See Your Own Results?</h2><p>Whether you want to handle it yourself with our DIY kit or have our team do it all for you, the first step is understanding where your credit stands today.</p><p><a class="btn" href="resources.html">Resources</a></p></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer class="interior-footer"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-col"><img src="/assets/dra-nav-logo.webp" alt="DRA Tax &amp; Financial Solutions logo" decoding="async"><p><strong>Deneshia Renee</strong><br>CEO<br>Down Right Ausome Wealth</p><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/dra.taxsolutions/">Instagram: dra.taxsolutions</a></p></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Explore</h4><a href="/">Home</a><a href="tax-services.html">Tax Services</a><a href="resources.html">Resources</a><a href="about.html">About</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a><a href="book-an-appointment.html">Book An Appointment</a></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Services</h4><a href="resources.html">Resources</a><a href="tax-services.html">Tax Preparation</a><a href="contact.html">Financial Coaching</a></div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Let&rsquo;s Connect</h4><p><a class="phone-link" href="tel:+14705161141">470 516 1141</a></p><p><a href="mailto:admin@downrightausomewealth.com">admin@downrightausomewealth.com</a></p><p>3205 Woodward Crossing Blvd, Suite F, Buford, GA</p><p>Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00am&ndash;8:00pm, Sunday closed</p></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>&copy; 2026 Down Right Ausome Wealth. All rights reserved.</span><span><a href="testimonials.html">Testimonials</a> <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a> &middot; <a href="disclaimer.html">Disclaimer</a></span></div><div class="compliance">No outcome, score increase, refund, or approval is guaranteed.</div></footer>\n',
